### Python ###
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
env/
*.egg

### Generated project data — reproducible via the scripts, shouldn't be versioned ###
wallet_profiles.csv
*.snappy.parquet

### Neo4j local state ###
# docker-compose.yml's named volumes (neo4j_data/neo4j_logs) live inside
# Docker, not the repo, but guard against anyone bind-mounting locally.
neo4j-data/
neo4j-logs/

### Spark local state ###
spark-warehouse/
metastore_db/
derby.log

# Structured Streaming checkpoint location (streaming_engine.py writes
# here — see checkpoints/neo4j_sink)
checkpoints/
_checkpoints/
**/checkpoint/

### Ivy / Maven dependency resolution (spark.jars.packages) ###
# Matches storage_layer.py / streaming_engine.py's dynamic package resolution
# writing to C:\Users\<user>\.ivy2 — only relevant if that cache ever ends up
# inside the repo directory instead of the user profile.
.ivy2/
ivy-cache/

### Hadoop on Windows ###
# C:\hadoop\logs referenced in streaming_engine.py's os.makedirs() call —
# only matters if C:\hadoop ever ends up nested under the repo.
hadoop/logs/
winutils.exe

### Docker ###
# No compose overrides are currently tracked separately, but ignore local
# override files if you ever add one for machine-specific tweaks.
docker-compose.override.yml

### IDE / OS noise ###
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

### Kafka (if ever run with a local, non-Docker broker) ###
kafka-logs/
zookeeper-data/

### Secrets ###
# graph_storage.py loads NEO4J_PASSWORD from this via python-dotenv —
# copy .env.example to .env locally, never commit the real file.
.env
.env.local

### Runtime state ###
# metrics_api.py's persisted metrics store (see STATE_PATH) — reproducible
# by running the pipeline, and would otherwise clutter every diff.
metrics_state.json

# evaluate_model.py's output — regenerate any time with `python evaluate_model.py`.
eval_report.json

### ML model artifacts — reproducible via train_isolation_forest.py ###
/isoforest_model.joblib
/isoforest_model_meta.json